## Active Database
# DatabaseType ∈ {none, PostgreSql, SqlServer, MySql, MariaDb, Sqlite, Oracle, MongoDb}
#
# ⚠️ Tier de validation par moteur (SSoT machine : .sdd/templates/combos.json
#    componentLevels.db — consomme par validate_stack_combo.py + le hook
#    preflight_stack_combo). Choisir en connaissance de cause :
#      🟢 validated    : none, PostgreSql
#      🟡 experimental : SqlServer            -> WARN, le pipeline continue
#      🔴 untested     : MySql, MariaDb, Sqlite, Oracle, MongoDb
#                        -> /sdd-full et /sdd-poc sont BLOQUES par le hook
#                           preflight_stack_combo. Bypass assume et audit-logue :
#                           SDD_ALLOW_UNTESTED_COMBO=1
#
# Real values in clear (stack.md is gitignored). Agent arch composes the
# connection string in RAM and writes it to the native config file ; the
# generated code reads via IConfiguration / @Value / config.get / Settings —
# NEVER via Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable or process.env.
# Keys : DB_HOST, DB_NAME, DB_PASSWORD, DB_PORT, DB_USER
 - DatabaseType: {{DatabaseType}}
{{DatabaseEnvLines}}

